#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:1 6a952d10b79d42818f69f3d79080a27d
msgid "Helix Operations"
msgstr "螺旋线参数操作"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:3 235179a95ee6495c8d38a87cd63d30f1
msgid ""
"In BES3, a helix is represented by 5 parameters: `dr`, `phi0`, `kappa`, "
"`dz`, `tanl`. Pybes3 provides a convenient way to parse these parameters "
"and perform pivot transformations with parameters and error matrices."
msgstr ""
"在 BES3 中，螺旋线（helix）由 5 个参数表示：`dr`、`phi0`、`kappa`、`dz`、`tanl`。Pybes3 "
"提供了便捷的方式来解析这些参数，并用参数与误差矩阵做 pivot 变换。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:5 f4a6acccc964454d9f5ffae61beb5048
msgid ""
"The implementation depends on "
"[`vector`](https://vector.readthedocs.io/en/latest/). It is recommended "
"to review [Vector "
"objects](https://vector.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/object.html) and "
"[Awkward Arrays of "
"vectors](https://vector.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/awkward.html) before"
" using helix objects, as they are used to represent helix position, "
"momentum, and pivot point."
msgstr ""
"实现依赖 [`vector`](https://vector.readthedocs.io/en/latest/)。建议在使用 helix "
"对象之前先了解 [Vector "
"objects](https://vector.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/object.html) 与 "
"[Awkward Arrays of "
"vectors](https://vector.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/awkward.html)，因为它们用于表示"
" helix 的位置、动量与 pivot 点。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:7 9205fa1bdffa4358a0aeed5344ad6198
msgid "Transformation rules"
msgstr "变换规则"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:9 5fc2eda1bb204939bb3a988fad554a66
msgid "The implementation follows these formulas:"
msgstr "实现遵循以下公式："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:11 9011621d61a84aea9318f43b52a952cf
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Position $[\\mathrm{cm}]$:"
msgstr "位置 $[\\mathrm{cm}]$："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:12 9ea8fbc0784f4c938f1490c50494b9fe
msgid "$x = x_0 + dr \\times \\cos \\varphi_0$"
msgstr "$x = x_0 + dr \\times \\cos \\varphi_0$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:13 867d4c753e904cb096f0bc5583af13bb
msgid "$y = y_0 + dr \\times \\sin \\varphi_0$"
msgstr "$y = y_0 + dr \\times \\sin \\varphi_0$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:14 965882cc4956418a818903beaa3a3342
msgid "$z = z_0 + dz$"
msgstr "$z = z_0 + dz$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:16 287e5b4239a44c6b89a4c8ffc93d8124
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Momentum $[\\mathrm{GeV}/c]$:"
msgstr "动量 $[\\mathrm{GeV}/c]$："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:17 07d7ac2e44514e47a5580ec24a6e191a
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$p_t = \\frac{1}{\\left| \\kappa \\right|}$"
msgstr "$p_t = \\frac{1}{\\left| \\kappa \\right|}$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:18 5b7a92e1f7bf42c78e5d86cabd449b2b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\varphi = \\varphi_0 + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$"
msgstr "$\\varphi = \\varphi_0 + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:19 fb7c497658b24788bd905a141d63089e
msgid "$p_x = p_t \\times \\cos(\\varphi)$"
msgstr "$p_x = p_t \\times \\cos(\\varphi)$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:20 0717529561284b50841bfb087056f90c
msgid "$p_y = p_t \\times \\sin(\\varphi)$"
msgstr "$p_y = p_t \\times \\sin(\\varphi)$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:21 825945c38ddf4b208b5d4f80220d1bc0
msgid "$p_z = p_t \\times \\tan\\lambda$"
msgstr "$p_z = p_t \\times \\tan\\lambda$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:23 79cc617849234e0aa97c15c9a42a25ad
msgid "Others:"
msgstr "其他："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:24 08fa608f441b4aaa9d9207a2a0527d23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathrm{charge} = \\mathrm{sign}(\\kappa)$"
msgstr "$\\mathrm{charge} = \\mathrm{sign}(\\kappa)$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:25 1303912d6ea5434783186cb7fa90556f
msgid ""
"$r_{\\mathrm{trk}} \\ [\\mathrm{cm}] = \\frac{1000}{2.99792458} \\times "
"p_t \\ [\\mathrm{GeV}/c]$"
msgstr ""
"$r_{\\mathrm{trk}} \\ [\\mathrm{cm}] = \\frac{1000}{2.99792458} \\times "
"p_t \\ [\\mathrm{GeV}/c]$"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:27 3df4d06bd91a47f5ac40a1afbbf26fa9
msgid "The magnetic field in BES3 is assumed to be 1 T."
msgstr "BES3 中的磁场按 1 T 处理。"

