msgid "You can change the pivot for each track in an awkward array of helix:"
msgstr "也可以为 awkward 数组中每条径迹单独改变 pivot："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:472 892b1fdc676148ff83267ea0f62bdb50
msgid "or change the pivot point to a specific point for each track:"
msgstr "或者把每条径迹的 pivot 点改成各自指定的点："

