msgstr "`change_pivot` 返回**新的** helix 对象/数组，不修改原对象。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:485 d8f4b67bd47d4af6b43b080f33f0bf8f
msgid "Helix comparison"
msgstr "helix 比较"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:487 8a9de8d0e07b49d98d679c76be6f1f16
msgid ""
"Compare two helix objects or arrays using the `isclose` method. If they "
"have different pivot points, the second helix is automatically "
"transformed to the first helix's pivot point before comparison."
msgstr ""
"用 `isclose` 方法比较两个 helix 对象或数组。若二者的 pivot 点不同，会先把第二个 helix 变换到第一个的 pivot "
"点再比较。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:517 06376457338341b3817d45b76c5b189a
msgid ""
"The comparison uses `numpy.isclose` to check whether the helix parameters"
" and error matrix are close enough. You can customize the tolerance:"
msgstr "比较使用 `numpy.isclose` 判断 helix 参数与误差矩阵是否足够接近，容差可以自定义："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/helix.md:523 7cd34e2b7c0c4feca0f322b7f63a5bda
msgid ""
"See "
"[numpy.isclose](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.isclose.html)"
" for more details on these parameters."
msgstr ""
"这些参数的更多细节见 "
"[numpy.isclose](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.isclose.html)。"

